      "heading": "Graph",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "A graph is a collection of vertices (nodes) and edges that connect pairs of vertices. Graphs are a powerful abstraction used in computer science to model relationships, networks, and structures such as social media connections, web pages, and transportation systems."
        }
      ],
      "wordCount": 40,
      "subsections": []
    },
